    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "Read the drive's status and determine if drive is ready. For Hard disk drives supporting buffered seeks this command is useful for determining the first drive to reach its target track. The command will be aborted, if the drive status read is incorrect.",
